    "flex_slots": [
      "Observed Squeaks versus Mickey Amber Champion packages change evasion, bounce density and Dale challenge math.",
      "Saved Moluk slots such as Mowgli and Mickey Expedition Leader remain defensible alternatives; current samples do not prove a strict upgrade."
    ],
    "vulnerabilities": [
      "Broad removal can punish an exerted board.",
      "Mike also provides access to opponents; bodyguards do not stop non-challenge interaction."
    ],
    "mulligan": "Prioritize an inkable one-cost character and a coherent two-cost follow-up. Keep discounts alongside actual deployment and ink; trim redundant expensive pieces. Keep Ursula more often against known song engines.",
